### Quality Standards

#### **All V0 Components Must:**
- ✅ Include TypeScript interfaces
- ✅ Use Tailwind CSS only (no inline styles)
- ✅ Add schema markup (JSON-LD)
- ✅ Be mobile-responsive
- ✅ Meet WCAG accessibility standards
- ✅ Optimize for Core Web Vitals
- ✅ Include SEO metadata
- ✅ Test thoroughly before deployment

### Deployment Process

1. Generate component with V0
2. Save to `/components/v0/` directory
3. Update page to use new component
4. Test locally with `vercel dev`
5. Build and verify with `vercel build`
6. Deploy with `vercel --prod`
7. Monitor performance and user feedback

### Success Metrics

Track improvements from V0 implementation:
- Development speed (target: 50% faster)
- Code quality (consistent patterns)
- SEO performance (better rankings)
- User experience (mobile-first design)
- Conversion rates (optimized CTAs)
- Accessibility scores (WCAG compliance)
- Performance scores (Core Web Vitals)
